@startuml
title SA-S04 — Business notification lifecycle
caption F07 · Notification ownership · FN-NOT-01–03
[*] --> Pending : Eligible business milestone recorded
Pending --> Sending : Worker takes attempt
Sending --> Delivered : Delivery confirmed
Sending --> Retry : Transient safe failure and retries remain
Retry --> Sending : Retry due
Sending --> FollowUp : Terminal or ambiguous outcome
FollowUp --> Resolved : Merchant records contact or reconciliation
FollowUp --> Pending : Explicit safe re-drive
note right of FollowUp : Business status remains authoritative
@enduml
